@@ -94,6 +94,13 @@ Changed
   wrapping messages.
 - The `:session-save` command now has a new `--no-history` flag, to exclude tab
   history.
+- Messages about a finished process now name its PID (e.g. `See :process 1234
+  for details.`), rather than pointing to the last started process.
+- When a process is killed by a signal, its message now names the signal (e.g.
+  `crashed with status 11 (SIGSEGV)`).
+- A process stopped with SIGTERM (e.g. via `:process <pid> terminate`) doesn't
+  show an error anymore, only an info message when started with `:spawn
+  --verbose`.
 - New widgets for `statusbar.widgets`:
   *  `clock`, showing the current time
   * `search_match`, showing the current match and total count when finding text
